        "original_id": "2e70372f-32f1-5914-9285-afe89c614567",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Sheridan County, Montana; Chandra Taal; Plentywood; Himachal Pradesh; Lahul and Spiti district\n- Organizations/Systems: Sher-Wood Airport; IATA; ICAO; FAA\n\nFacts:\n- Sheridan County is a county in the U.S. state of Montana.\n- Chandra Taal, also called Chandra Tal, is in the Spiti area of Lahul and Spiti district in Himachal Pradesh, India.\n- Sher-Wood Airport is a public-use airport located 1 nautical mile northeast of the central business district of Plentywood in Sheridan County, Montana, United States.\n- Sher-Wood Airport has the codes IATA PWD, ICAO KPWD, and FAA LID PWD.",
